:"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-16T22:29:11-08:00","id":1050326,"title":"","content":"At the current rate, we could see Mummy 2e announced at this Gen Con (I don't think this will happen, but that's the pattern), and then spend another one to three years in development. In my wildest dreams they do Book of Going Westward and possibly a Night Horrors book to fill the interim time.<br /> <br /> Also remember that we're still getting two chapters in Dark Eras Companion and some material in Dark Eras 2 and The Crossover Chronicle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T00:28:42-08:00","id":1050351,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/811476-cursed-necropolis-rio?p=1050326#post1050326\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At the current rate, we could see Mummy 2e announced at this Gen Con (I don't think this will happen, but that's the pattern), and then spend another one to three years in development. In my wildest dreams they do Book of Going Westward and possibly a Night Horrors book to fill the interim time.<br /> <br /> Also remember that we're still getting two chapters in Dark Eras Companion and some material in Dark Eras 2 and The Crossover Chronicle.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ohh I didn't know there would be two chapters! I remember the Cleopatra one, what's the other?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T01:21:38-08:00","id":1050363,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TyrannicalRabbit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/811476-cursed-necropolis-rio?p=1050351#post1050351\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ohh I didn't know there would be two chapters! I remember the Cleopatra one, what's the other?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Mutapa Empire. It's the Mage/Mummy crossover that's been causing something of a stir elsewhere.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"ht