arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Odds of a second edition look pretty good. Rio suggests using the Chronicles of Darkness book for cultists and more than a few of the characters have 2nd ed Virtues and Vices, rather than the classic 7.<br /> <br /> Mind you, I am more than a tad intrigued by some of the sneaky bits in the Rio book. Between the Fountains and the Utterances they teach (the Ebon Mask, Forge of Falsehood, both of which have Ren tiers), combined with one of the 'unique' benefits of presumably Nithian Architecture in chapter 2 (if i remember correctly), it appears on the Temakah has a vested interest in the area.</div> </div> </div> </div>So quick question with that first bit in mind... who's listed as the book's developer?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"ht